<title>UK: Fokus Bank sets $100 mln perpetual step-up FRN.</title>
<headline>Fokus Bank sets $100 mln perpetual step-up FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following step-up callable floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Salomon Brothers International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FOKUS BANK A.S.A</p>
<p> AMT    $100 MLN	BASE	 6M-LIBOR  MATURITY    PERPETUAL</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN    *+70 BP    PAY DATE    03.MAR.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A3	  ISS PRICE  99.795    REOFFER     99.795</p>
<p> NOTES     *TILL 03.MAR.04 THEN IF NOT CALLED STEPS-UP TO</p>
<p>		145 BP OVER 6M LIBOR.</p>
<p>	 **CALLABLE ON 03.MAR.04 AND EVERY COUPON DATE THEREAFTER.</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/NO</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  NORWAY    TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> NOTES	UNSECURED AND SUBORDINATED</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
